    "title": "Lady Cats Season Ends In Softball Semifinals…Annies/Lady Rams Open Post Seasons Today…OPS Moves On - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WJBD Staff ,\n15 hours ago The Salem Lady Wildcats softball season came to an end at Breese Central yesterday losing to the host Lady Cougars 9-0 as Salem was outhit 14-1. Marah Johnson had the lone single for Salem in her final game before moving on to play for Kaskaskia College next year. Kenley Cripps and Morgan Honerkamp pitched in the Salem loss. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
